1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 8]

3
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,520
So it really is you, Shen Shuying!

4
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:49,320
Bring me a bow!

5
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,000
Are you all right?

6
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,070
I'm fine.

7
00:01:07,430 --> 00:01:07,950
Let's go.

8
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,200
After them!

9
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:11,230
Yes!

10
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,230
Come, get on!

11
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,070
Go!

12
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:51,950
That arrow you took for me

13
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,480
made the Yin-Yang Gu's pain worse.

14
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:54,590
We have to break it soon.

15
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:02,310
I want my medicine first.

16
00:02:03,150 --> 00:02:04,430
Is that more important than
breaking the Gu?

17
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,910
Do you expect me to take it
myself?

18
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,240
Is this enough?

19
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:29,470
Then break the Gu.

20
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,080
Wait.

21
00:03:32,870 --> 00:03:33,680
What now?

22
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,240
It itches.

23
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:40,910
My back itches.

24
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:44,240
What does that have to do
with me?

25
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:48,750
I can't reach it.

26
00:03:52,590 --> 00:03:53,310
Where?

27
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,190
Here.

28
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,310
I don't want you to be with me

29
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,480
just because of the Yin-Yang Gu.

30
00:04:19,390 --> 00:04:20,680
The question I asked you last time,

31
00:04:21,270 --> 00:04:22,430
have you thought about it?

32
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:24,920
What question?

33
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:27,720
Choose me.

34
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,800
I've already let you go.

35
00:04:35,950 --> 00:04:36,750
Shen Shuying.

36
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,870
You know what I mean.

37
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:44,510
I don't believe you feel
nothing for me.

38
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:47,240
You thought I was dead
and wept for me.

39
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,160
Even if the choice is agonizing,

40
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,870
I believe we can change
things in this life.

41
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:53,950
I've already proven to you

42
00:04:53,950 --> 00:04:55,560
that Xiao Ningze isn't worth
holding on to.

43
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:57,870
Even as an ally,

44
00:04:58,510 --> 00:04:59,600
he's not reliable.

45
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,600
What are you still hesitating for?

46
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,680
What do you want?

47
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,160
Stand by my side.

48
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:11,950
In this life, we won't fight each other.

49
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:13,600
We won't be enemies.

50
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,270
Fate gave us another chance.

51
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,800
Let's start over. All right?

52
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:34,160
Why torture yourself like this?

53
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:36,360
This isn't torture.

54
00:05:36,950 --> 00:05:38,070
Our last life was.

55
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:44,510
Let's

56
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:47,390
leave the capital together. Okay?

57
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,750
If I say no,

58
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,950
what will you do?

59
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:54,160
I'll be relentless.

60
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,800
I'll cling to you shamelessly.

61
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,720
Then you'd better live well.

62
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:08,310
Stop torturing yourself.

63
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:14,160
Are you worried about me?

64
00:06:14,750 --> 00:06:16,070
Do you have feelings for me?

65
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:37,070
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

66
00:06:37,630 --> 00:06:41,850
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

67
00:06:42,270 --> 00:06:46,480
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

68
00:06:46,980 --> 00:06:49,060
♪If fate turns once more♪

69
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:51,910
♪Will our endings trade places♪

70
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:56,820
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

71
00:06:56,930 --> 00:07:01,020
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

72
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:05,070
♪What tone should I take♪

73
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:08,180
♪To leave no trace♪

74
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:10,770
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

75
00:07:11,150 --> 00:07:15,480
♪But the moment you come close♪

76
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:20,130
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

77
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:22,990
♪The lamplight flickers♪

78
00:07:22,990 --> 00:07:24,770
♪Like your eyes♪

79
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:25,430
It feels like

80
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:27,360
we haven't had a quiet moment
like this in ages.

81
00:07:31,750 --> 00:07:32,920
What, not used to it?

82
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,240
I've longed for it.

83
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,680
This is a rare peaceful moment.

84
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:42,920
Get some sleep.

85
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:46,560
Tomorrow morning will be chaotic again.

86
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:53,260
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

87
00:07:53,620 --> 00:07:57,990
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

88
00:07:58,670 --> 00:08:03,090
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

89
00:08:03,430 --> 00:08:05,750
♪A test used as an excuse♪

90
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:08,590
♪To stir the waters♪

91
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:12,760
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

92
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,160
[Jufu Restaurant]

93
00:08:17,790 --> 00:08:20,140
♪The lamplight flickers♪

94
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:22,570
♪What tone should I take♪

95
00:08:28,510 --> 00:08:29,310
Shuying.

96
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,320
Shuying.

97
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,510
Shuying.

98
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,720
Young Master, you're awake.

99
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,480
Did you see Shen Shuying?

100
00:08:39,910 --> 00:08:40,960
Miss Shen left early.

101
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,030
Didn't she tell you?

102
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:43,670
She's gone?

103
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,320
She must have had urgent business

104
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:48,080
and didn't want to wake you.

105
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,440
I feel like it's not that simple.

106
00:08:59,270 --> 00:09:00,080
My Lady.

107
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:02,440
Aren't we fleeing with General Lu?

108
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:04,870
I never flee.

109
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:06,550
Then where are we going?

110
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,320
Back to the Eighth Prince's
residence.

111
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:10,440
After everything that happened
last night,

112
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,790
we're still going back?

113
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,670
I'm the Eighth Prince's consort.

114
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,440
If I don't go back to the
residence,

115
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,670
where else would I go?

116
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:20,150
But... the Eighth Prince wants
you dead.

117
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:23,000
I'm not the one he wants dead.

118
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:25,080
It's that new prince.

119
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,270
But we never found

120
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,670
that new prince.

121
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,480
But we've confirmed one thing.

122
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,120
In this life,

123
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:35,960
that prince never appeared.

124
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:37,360
That's enough.

125
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,600
How is that enough?

126
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,790
Come have a look!

127
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,150
Come.

128
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:45,200
Thin-skinned buns, full of
filling! Take a look!

129
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,080
Help me spread a rumor.

130
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,720
I want the whole capital,

131
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:52,320
every street and alley buzzing
about it.

132
00:09:58,390 --> 00:09:59,550
Wh-What?

133
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,000
You want to spread a rumor

134
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:06,240
that Lu Qingcang is
His Majesty's illegitimate son?

135
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,390
That will make the Eighth Prince

136
00:10:09,390 --> 00:10:10,630
hunt General Lu down, won't it?

137
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:12,670
My Lady.

138
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,000
You still want General Lu dead?

139
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:16,750
He won't die.

140
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:20,080
But since Heaven gives me
another chance to start over,

141
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,960
I can't spend it on the run
with him.

142
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,750
If the new prince
were anyone else,

143
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:27,720
Wei Chengjun would still side
with Xiao Ningze.

144
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:30,000
But Lu Qingcang is his man,

145
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:33,360
so the alliance between them

146
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,440
will surely break.

147
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:38,080
Women are truly terrifying.

148
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,240
But My Lady, you...

149
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,670
I thought

150
00:10:41,670 --> 00:10:44,120
you and General Lu had made up.

151
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:45,670
At that moment,

152
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,390
he was hurt because of me.

153
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,600
I don't want him to suffer more

154
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:51,480
out of his obsession.

155
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:55,080
But we're two cursed people,
sharing life and death.

156
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,200
One disaster breeds the next.

157
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,360
To walk away from all that
karma in peace

158
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,150
is hard, isn't it?

159
00:10:59,440 --> 00:10:59,910
Let's go.

160
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:21,510
Shen Shuying!
How dare you come back?

161
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,870
I've done nothing wrong.

162
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,510
Why wouldn't I come back?

163
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,550
You failed to get the job done!

164
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,670
You came without weapons

165
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:32,320
and didn't send anyone to
arrest me.

166
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,150
So you've heard the news.

167
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,000
Why did it have
to be Lu Qingcang?

168
00:11:39,870 --> 00:11:41,240
Why him again?

169
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:43,630
Why is he the prince
lost among the people?

170
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:46,080
Why? Why?

171
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,360
You're all I have left.

172
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:52,790
Shuying.

173
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,270
You'll help me, won't you?

174
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,390
I don't work for free.

175
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,000
I promise you.

176
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:04,240
The Empress's seat will be yours.

177
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:09,150
Promises like that are worthless.

178
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:11,750
What do you actually want?

179
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:15,240
I want the Golden Armor Guard.

180
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:17,550
Full command
of the Golden Armor Guard

181
00:12:18,030 --> 00:12:19,480
and the recent rosters.

182
00:12:20,790 --> 00:12:22,200
Every detail of it.

183
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,480
You'll never amount to much.

184
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:32,030
No wonder His Majesty
won't name you heir.

185
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:40,870
Promise me.

186
00:12:41,870 --> 00:12:43,360
Help me kill Lu Qingcang.

187
00:12:44,270 --> 00:12:46,270
Clear every obstacle to the
throne for me.

188
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:25,780
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

189
00:13:26,340 --> 00:13:30,560
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

190
